# looot agent token. Server side only, never sent to the browser.
# Create one with `looot login`, or in the looot web app under Settings, "Agent tokens".
# Needed for a real pull. Not needed for `npm run demo`, `--dry-run` or `--demo`.
LOOOT_TOKEN=your-looot-agent-token
# Optional, defaults to https://api.looot.ai
LOOOT_API_URL=https://api.looot.ai
# Optional, where the web UI saves the last pull. Default: ./.looot-data
# LOOOT_REVIEWS_DATA_DIR=

# Optional LLM step that merges and renames themes. Off unless BOTH are set.
# It sends theme labels, keywords and two short quotes per theme, never the full review set.
# Billed by your model provider, not by looot.
# REVIEWS_LLM_API_KEY=
# REVIEWS_LLM_MODEL=
# REVIEWS_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com
